\det(A) = \sum_{\sigma} \text{sgn}(\sigma) \cdot a_{1\sigma(1)}a_{2\sigma(2)}\cdots a_{n\sigma(n)}
$$

性质包括：行列式与转置相等，交换两行变号，某行全为0则行列式为0，行成比例则行列式为0。例如，对矩阵 $A = \begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\ 3 & 4\end{bmatrix}$，行列式为 $1 \cdot 4 - 2 \cdot 3 = -2$。", "finish_reason": "stop", "choices": null}

